  "preamble": "The PIE palatovelar *ǵ, transcribed here as [ɡʲ], became the voiceless alveolar affricate [t͡s] (ծ c) in Armenian. The change combines the satem assibilation of the palatovelars with the Armenian consonant shift, which devoiced the PIE plain voiced stops (*d > t, *g > k); the voiceless palatovelar *ḱ gave s and the aspirated *ǵʰ gave ձ [d͡z].",
